# Metadata Domains

The framework manages multiple metadata categories.

---

## Dataset Metadata

Examples include:

- dataset name
- business description
- storage location
- owner
- version
- creation timestamp
- update timestamp

---

## Schema Metadata

Examples include:

- column names
- data types
- nullable status
- schema evolution
- field counts

---

## Statistical Metadata

Examples include:

- row counts
- column counts
- null percentages
- distinct values
- numeric summaries

---

## Operational Metadata

Examples include:

- execution timestamps
- processing duration
- acquisition history
- validation status
- pipeline version

---

## Lineage Metadata

Prepared to support future capabilities including:

- upstream dependencies
- downstream consumers
- transformation history
- dataset relationships

